{"id":"055771afd013f180","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-lem-L-cardinal-calculation.md","title":"L Cardinal Calculation","display":"lem-L-cardinal-calculation — L Cardinal Calculation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-L-cardinal-calculation","aliases":["58-lem-L-cardinal-calculation","L Cardinal Size Lemma"],"display":"lem-L-cardinal-calculation — L Cardinal Calculation","depends_on":["[[58-df-l-hierarchy]]","[[58-df-def-operator]]","[[58-thm-L-is-transitive]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]","[[58-df-aleph]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-L-cardinal-calculation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-L-cardinal-calculation</span><span>L Cardinal Size Lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-L-cardinal-calculation — L Cardinal Calculation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cfa29222af6471b2\" href=\"?note=cfa29222af6471b2\" title=\"58-df-l-hierarchy\">58-df-l-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a2e92340a207163\" href=\"?note=9a2e92340a207163\" title=\"58-df-def-operator\">58-df-def-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"475f48ba187a2469\" href=\"?note=475f48ba187a2469\" title=\"58-thm-L-is-transitive\">58-thm-L-is-transitive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"58-df-aleph\">58-df-aleph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\bullet\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(L_\\bullet\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> is the set-level ordinal predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\">\\(\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\\)</span> is the metatheoretic constructible-hierarchy predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega \\leq \\alpha\">\\(\\omega \\leq \\alpha\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}L\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}calculation}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\omega\\leq\\alpha\n\\to |L_\\alpha|=|\\alpha|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}L\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}calculation}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\omega\\leq\\alpha\n\\to |L_\\alpha|=|\\alpha|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For infinite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>, one also has <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathrm{Def}(M)| = |M|\">\\(|\\mathrm{Def}(M)| = |M|\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This size estimate is one of the key inputs in cardinal calculations inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The conclusion is conditional on the imported hierarchy recursion; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span> is not left as an unconstrained symbol, and ordinalhood is expressed by the set predicate rather than membership in a proper class.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-l-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"cfa29222af6471b2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-l-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-def-operator","status":"resolved","id":"9a2e92340a207163","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-def-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-L-is-transitive","status":"resolved","id":"475f48ba187a2469","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-L-is-transitive]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-aleph","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-aleph]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ is the set-level ordinal predicate (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega \\leq \\alpha$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\bullet\\in\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega \\leq \\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}L\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}calculation}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{LHierarchy}_S(L_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\omega\\leq\\alpha\n\\to |L_\\alpha|=|\\alpha|.","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathrm{Def}(M)| = |M|","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1416,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3912","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-lem-L-cardinal-calculation.md|58-lem-L-cardinal-calculation]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["cfa29222af6471b2","9a2e92340a207163","475f48ba187a2469","2be08d4ee8aa1590","535817bf563314f5","5045d216c83e75cb","5582a281f15a33c2"]}